Dear Chair Brooks-Powers;

Downstate New York ADAPT (DNY ADAPT") is a grassroots, non- hierarchical community of people with all types of disabilities advocating for the civil rights of people with disabilities, including, but not limited to, the right to live and fully participate in the larger community. Downstate New York adapt covers the five counties in New York City, the two counties on Long Island, Nassau

